<article class="Page ArticlePage ArticlePage--modern " id="ArticleContent">
    <div id="43c43a5c"><div class="kuvzRZlS6ToNxTRdGGYO"><div style="width:0%" class="YimfpneTSknkmd8AIZxN"></div></div><script>(window.__reactProps = window.__reactProps || {})['43c43a5c-json'] = {"elementSelector":"#ArticleContent"};</script></div>
    <div class="Page__wrapper">
        
<div id="f54456cd"><ol class="jIjgn7qoTMH3b4e0jW3j" id="breadcrumbs"><li><a class="QqohSkg5NSBKEgLCAL46" href="/">Kristiania</a></li><li><a class="QqohSkg5NSBKEgLCAL46" href="/aktuelt/">Aktuelt</a></li><li><a class="QqohSkg5NSBKEgLCAL46" href="/aktuelt/2026/">2026</a></li><li><a class="QqohSkg5NSBKEgLCAL46" href="/aktuelt/2026/04/">04</a></li><li><a class="QqohSkg5NSBKEgLCAL46">Stian får betalt for å tenke som en hacker</a></li></ol><script>(window.__reactProps = window.__reactProps || {})['f54456cd-json'] = {"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Kristiania","link":"/"},{"name":"Aktuelt","link":"/aktuelt/"},{"name":"2026","link":"/aktuelt/2026/"},{"name":"04","link":"/aktuelt/2026/04/"},{"name":"Stian får betalt for å tenke som en hacker","link":null}]};</script></div>
        <h1 class="Page__title">
<p>Stian får betalt for å tenke som en hacker</p>
</h1>
        <div class="ArticlePage__hero">
            



<div id="018160bd"></div>    <div class="HeroLegacy ">
        <div class="HeroLegacy__media">

                <figure class="HeroLegacy__image ">
                    <picture><source sizes="(max-width: 1135px) 100vw, (min-width: 1136px) 1136px" srcset="/contentassets/d79def7392874399b0f67b11effbbb56/microsoftteams-image-1.jpeg?width=375&amp;rxy=0.62,0.28 375w, /contentassets/d79def7392874399b0f67b11effbbb56/microsoftteams-image-1.jpeg?width=768&amp;rxy=0.62,0.28 768w, /contentassets/d79def7392874399b0f67b11effbbb56/microsoftteams-image-1.jpeg?width=1136&amp;rxy=0.62,0.28 1136w, /contentassets/d79def7392874399b0f67b11effbbb56/microsoftteams-image-1.jpeg?width=2272&amp;rxy=0.62,0.28 2272w" /><img alt="Stian Kv&#xE5;lshagen avbildet utenfor Kristiania." loading="eager" src="/contentassets/d79def7392874399b0f67b11effbbb56/microsoftteams-image-1.jpeg?width=1136&amp;rxy=0.62,0.28" /></picture>
                </figure>
<div class="HeroLegacy__imageCaption"><span>Stian gikk fra &#xE5; drive bakeri til &#xE5; bygge og sikre digitale l&#xF8;sninger. I dag gj&#xF8;r han komplekse sikkerhetsutfordringer forst&#xE5;elige og brukbare for andre.</span><span>Foto: Jonatan Arvid Quintero</span></div>        </div>
    </div>

                <div class="ArticlePage__summaryBox">
                    
                            <div class="ArticlePage__infoContainer">
            <ul>
                    <li class="ArticlePage__authorsInfo">
                        <h3 class="ArticlePage__authorInfoHeading">Skrevet av</h3>
                        <ul class="ArticlePage__authorsList">
                                <li>        <div class="ArticlePage__authorBylineInfo">
            
    <div class="ArticlePage__authorName">
            <p class="ArticlePage__authorName">Redaksjonen</p>
    </div>

        </div>
</li>
                        </ul>
                    </li>
                    <li class="ArticlePage__dateInfo">
                        <h3>Sist oppdatert</h3>
                        <p>
8. april 2026                        </p>
                    </li>
                

                
            </ul>
        </div>

                </div>
        </div>
        <div class="Page__header">
            

                <div class="Page__intro">
<p><span data-contrast="auto"><span>For noen er veien inn i&nbsp;</span><span>tech</span><span>&nbsp;tydelig fra start. For Stian Kvålshagen startet den på barnerommet</span><span>,</span><span>&nbsp;og førte via bakeri til en karriere innen cybersikkerhet. I dag jobber han med å beskytte systemer, lede team og bygge løsninger som faktisk blir brukt.</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="Page__body ArticlePage__body">
        <div class="Richtext">
            
<div class="Richtext__wrapper"><div class="PageLayout__grid"><div class="Richtext__content PageLayout__content"><p><span data-contrast="none"><span>Stian<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>beskriver seg selv som en tekniker<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><span data-contrast="auto"><span>«</span></span><span data-contrast="none"><span>by<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>heart</span></span><span data-contrast="auto"><span>»</span></span><span data-contrast="none"><span>.<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>Nå<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>jobbe</span><span>r 31-åringen<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>som<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>teknisk<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>team lead innen cybersikkerhet</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span>i <a href="https://www.storebrand.no/?gad_source=1&amp;gad_campaignid=139766627&amp;gbraid=0AAAAADrgRF1LzRtckRMPaRC2r-ke8ZTpN&amp;gclid=Cj0KCQjw1ZjOBhCmARIsADDuFTA0qD2ErfL7KHX-cJsjxc61Fl7GzJloQj-ScERlznyi5gR5gkrGezoaArBiEALw_wcB">Storebrand</a>.&nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:276}">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto"><span>– Det mest spennende er å ta noe komplisert og gjøre det så enkelt at flere kan bruke det, sier han.</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}">&nbsp;</span></p>
<h2 aria-level="2"><span data-contrast="none"><span data-ccp-parastyle="heading 2">Fra<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span data-ccp-parastyle="heading 2">Baker Hansen</span><span data-ccp-parastyle="heading 2"><span>&nbsp;</span>til cybersikkerhet</span></span></h2>
<p><span data-contrast="auto"><span>Da vi møtte Stian første gang i 2021, hadde han akkurat begynt på <a href="/studier/bachelor/cybersikkerhet/">Bachelor i cybersikkerhet</a> ved Kristiania.</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span>Livet tok en brå<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>vend</span><span>ing som gjorde at veien dit ikke var rett fram.&nbsp;</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="none"><span>–<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>P</span><span>appa<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>gikk<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>bort, og da ble tankene om fremtiden snudd på hodet, forteller han.</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:360}">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto"><span>Stian tok over familiebedriften og</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>drev Baker Hansen</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span>i Sandvika</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span>i f</span><span>em<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>år</span><span>, en erfaring han aldri ville vært foruten.<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>Likevel slapp aldri interessen for teknologi taket.</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p><strong><span data-contrast="auto">– Tech-drømmen lå alltid der. Til slutt bestemte jeg meg for å satse fullt,&nbsp;sier&nbsp;han.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto"><span>Det valget har han ikke angret på.</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="none"><span>Studiemiljøet beskr</span><span>ev<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>han som godt, med 209 studenter med varierende teknologibakgrunn. Til sammen utgj</span><span>orde</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span>de en stor og hyggelig gjeng som ha</span><span>dde</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span>det gøy og lær</span><span>te<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>mye.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="none"><span>– Jeg k</span><span>un</span><span>n</span><span>e</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span>lett sitte to timer ekstra med studiene uten at det t</span><span>ok</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span>energi. Det føl</span><span>tes</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span>så riktig, og jeg kos</span><span>te<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>meg skikkelig</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span>under studietida</span><span>.</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:360}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div></div></div><section class="Richtext__block">

<div class="wrapper"><div class="PageLayout__grid"><div class="PageLayout__content CalloutWrapper"><div id="4e52ad1f"><div class="o5HieFYoWOxBSqBaMxuJ _gcyNIafWvucm79gTNEn Cl59d9a8ARh4rDeSU3Lx"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL mZq7ShjcsiUFkcP0AShl"><picture><source sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (min-width: 768) 120px" srcset="/contentassets/1d374cf453fb4a16a203819719987cc7/jefferson-santos-9socnyqmkzi-unsplash.jpg?width=120 120w, /contentassets/1d374cf453fb4a16a203819719987cc7/jefferson-santos-9socnyqmkzi-unsplash.jpg?width=258 258w"><img src="/contentassets/1d374cf453fb4a16a203819719987cc7/jefferson-santos-9socnyqmkzi-unsplash.jpg?width=258" alt="En ung mann sitter foran PC-en og jobber." style="object-position:52% 41%" loading="lazy"></picture></div><div class="ASqyfzgRZ5D3rKknUKxU"><p class="Y5fNcn2VNSt1xS89TywJ">Derfor er studiet i cybersikkerhet viktig</p><p class="XY5TBgqMrRqFYOQ7O7ZQ">Blir ettertraktet på arbeidsmarkedet og viktig i kampen mot nettkriminalitet. </p><a href="/aktuelt/2021/09/hvorfor-velge-cybersikkerhet/" class="XezMfDvRba8HKhHr79wm BaRcrU5NpyAMFJiitXyJ xZcYbmyYIBXZ099OMnvD" data-owned=""><div class="DdPYOTimBd1c8zDeoFgi">Les mer her!</div></a></div></div><script>(window.__reactProps = window.__reactProps || {})['4e52ad1f-json'] = {"title":"Derfor er studiet i cybersikkerhet viktig","text":"Blir ettertraktet på arbeidsmarkedet og viktig i kampen mot nettkriminalitet. ","link":{"label":"Les mer her!","href":"/aktuelt/2021/09/hvorfor-velge-cybersikkerhet/","external":false,"showIsExternal":true},"image":{"author":null,"caption":null,"url":"/contentassets/1d374cf453fb4a16a203819719987cc7/jefferson-santos-9socnyqmkzi-unsplash.jpg","alt":"En ung mann sitter foran PC-en og jobber.","focalPoint":{"x":0.52,"y":0.41},"lazyLoading":true},"backgroundVariant":"grey"};</script></div></div></div></div></section><div class="Richtext__wrapper"><div class="PageLayout__grid"><div class="Richtext__content PageLayout__content">
<h2><span data-contrast="none"><span data-ccp-parastyle="heading 2">– Andreåret var et vendepunkt</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;335559738&quot;:299,&quot;335559739&quot;:299}">&nbsp;</span></h2>
<p><span data-contrast="auto"><span>Stian beskriver studietiden som både morsom og krevende, men trekker spesielt fram ett år:</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}">&nbsp;</span></p>
<blockquote class="Richtext__blockquote">
<p><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}"><span data-contrast="auto">Den hands-on læringen var det som virkelig gjorde at ting satt.</span>&nbsp;</span></p>
</blockquote>
<p><span data-contrast="auto"><span>– Andreåret var det mest spennende. Da fikk vi jobbe mer praktisk. Jeg er en sånn som må teste ting selv for å forstå det.</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto"><span>Han brukte mye tid utenfor forelesning på å eksperimentere: sette opp egne systemer, bryte dem ned</span><span>, for å så<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>bygge dem opp igjen.</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p><strong><span data-contrast="auto">– Den&nbsp;hands-on&nbsp;læringen var det som virkelig gjorde at ting satt.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto"><span>Selv om siste året inneholdt mer teori, ser han i ettertid hvor viktig det var.</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto"><span>– Emner som GRC (</span><span>Governance</span><span>, Risk and<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>Compliance</span><span>) og forskningsmetoder er kanskje ikke de mest spennende der og da, men de er ekstremt relevante i arbeidslivet.</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}">&nbsp;</span></p></div></div></div><div class="Richtext__wrapper"><div class="PageLayout__grid"><figure class="ImageFullWidth PageLayout__content"><picture style="padding-top: 66.63637%"><source sizes="(max-width: 1339px) 100vw, (min-width: 1440px) 1440px" srcset="/contentassets/d79def7392874399b0f67b11effbbb56/bilde2.jpeg?width=375&amp;rxy=0.49,0.32 375w, /contentassets/d79def7392874399b0f67b11effbbb56/bilde2.jpeg?width=768&amp;rxy=0.49,0.32 768w, /contentassets/d79def7392874399b0f67b11effbbb56/bilde2.jpeg?width=1440&amp;rxy=0.49,0.32 1440w"><img alt="Stian Kvålshagen avbildet utenfor Høyskolen Kristiania." src="/contentassets/d79def7392874399b0f67b11effbbb56/bilde2.jpeg"></picture><figcaption class="PageLayout__content"><span>Fra bakeri til cybersikkerhet: Stian fant veien tilbake til tech-drømmen og leder i dag et team som beskytter Storebrands systemer.</span><span>Foto: Jonatan Arvid Quintero</span></figcaption></figure></div></div><div class="Richtext__wrapper"><div class="PageLayout__grid"><div class="Richtext__content PageLayout__content">
<h2 aria-level="2"><span data-contrast="none"><span data-ccp-parastyle="heading 2">Bachelor med ekte konsekvenser</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;335559738&quot;:299,&quot;335559739&quot;:299}">&nbsp;</span></h2>
<p><span data-contrast="auto"><span>På bacheloroppgaven fikk Stian og gruppa jobbe tett med næringslivet.</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto"><span>De gjennomførte såkalt<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>«</span><span>purple</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>teaming</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span>»</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span>i samarbeid med Storebrand</span><span>,</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span>en metode der man både angriper og forsvarer systemer for å avdekke svakheter.</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:276}">&nbsp;</span></p>
<blockquote class="Richtext__blockquote">
<p><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:276}"><span data-contrast="auto"><span>Det var utrolig lærerikt å jobbe med noe som faktisk betyr noe i virkeligheten.</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}">&nbsp;</span></span></p>
</blockquote>
<p><span><span data-contrast="auto"><span>– Vi<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span></span><span data-contrast="auto"><span>prøv</span><span>de</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span>å tenke hvordan</span></span><span><span data-contrast="auto"><span><span>&nbsp;</span>ekte<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span></span><span><span data-contrast="auto"><span>trusselaktører</span></span></span><span data-contrast="auto"><span><span>&nbsp;</span>tenker,</span><span>&nbsp;</span><span>og testet hvordan de kunne angripe en finansinstitusjon. Så sjekket vi om angrepene ble oppdaget.</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto"><span>Hvis ikke, måtte de utvikle løsninger som kunne stoppe dem i fremtiden.</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto"><span>– Det var utrolig lærerikt å jobbe med noe som faktisk betyr noe i virkeligheten.</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto"><span>Og r</span><span>esultatet? Alle på gruppa fikk jobb.</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}">&nbsp;</span></p>
<h2 aria-level="2"><span data-contrast="none"><span data-ccp-parastyle="heading 2">Fra<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span data-ccp-parastyle="heading 2">deltid<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span data-ccp-parastyle="heading 2">til team lead</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;335559738&quot;:299,&quot;335559739&quot;:299}">&nbsp;</span></h2>
</div></div></div><section class="Richtext__block">

<div id="989a4754"></div><div class="wrapper SidebarImageWrapper"><div class="PageLayout__grid"><div class="PageLayout__content">        <figure class="SidebarImage ">
            

<picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 768px, (min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw" srcset="/contentassets/95cef898d3604bd59a18ce196f147837/stian.jpg?width=375&amp;rxy=0.75,0.36 375w, /contentassets/95cef898d3604bd59a18ce196f147837/stian.jpg?width=500&amp;rxy=0.75,0.36 500w, /contentassets/95cef898d3604bd59a18ce196f147837/stian.jpg?width=768&amp;rxy=0.75,0.36 768w, /contentassets/95cef898d3604bd59a18ce196f147837/stian.jpg?width=1024&amp;rxy=0.75,0.36 1024w"><img alt="Stian presenterer noe i en power point presentasjon på jobb." src="/contentassets/95cef898d3604bd59a18ce196f147837/stian.jpg?width=500&amp;rxy=0.75,0.36"></picture>
            <figcaption class="SidebarImage__caption"><span>I rollen som teknisk team lead jobber Stian tett med både utviklere og fagmiljøer.</span><span>Foto: Storebrand</span></figcaption>
        </figure>
</div></div></div></section><div class="Richtext__wrapper"><div class="PageLayout__grid"><div class="Richtext__content PageLayout__content">
<p><span data-contrast="auto"><span>Stian startet<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>fulltid i</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span>Storebrand<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>etter studiene, og har hatt ulike roller siden det. I dag er han<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>teknisk<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>team lead<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>innen Cyber<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>Defence</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span>Engineering.&nbsp;</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p><strong><span data-contrast="auto">– Nå leder jeg et team som jobber på tvers av fagområder for å skape bedre sikkerhet i hele organisasjonen. Det er skikkelig spennende.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto"><span>Stian har alltid vært interessert i såkalt penetrasjonstesting, altså å<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>hacke</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span>systemer for å gjøre dem tryggere. Men<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>ondsinnede aktører bruker som regel mye enklere metoder for å få tilgang til systemene, derfor handler mye av jobben om det.</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:276}">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto"><span>– Det er ikke alltid full-</span><span>on</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span>hacking. Ofte handler det om å finne de enkle svakhetene først</span><span>.</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto"><span>Det Stian liker aller best handler ikke bare om teknologi</span><span>,<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>men om mennesker og prosesser:</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p><strong><span data-contrast="auto">– Hvis jeg lager noe som bare jeg kan bruke, har det begrenset verdi. Men hvis jeg lager noe alle utviklere kan bruke, da skalerer det.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto"><span>Han jobber med å gjøre sikkerhet forståelig og tilgjengelig for flere.</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto"><span>– Det handler om å finne balansen mellom komplekse prosesser og enkle løsninger.</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}">&nbsp;</span></p>
<h2 aria-level="2"><span data-contrast="none"><span data-ccp-parastyle="heading 2">Sti</span><span data-ccp-parastyle="heading 2">ans beste tips til studenter</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;335559738&quot;:299,&quot;335559739&quot;:299}">&nbsp;</span></h2>
<p><span data-contrast="auto"><span>Stian er tydelig på hva som skiller de som lykkes:</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}">&nbsp;</span></p>
<ul class="Richtext__ul">
<li aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="2" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"><span data-contrast="auto"><span>Utforsk utover studiet. Ikke stopp når forelesning er ferdig. Teste ting selv, og bygg din egen forståelse.</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}">&nbsp;</span></li>
</ul>
<ul class="Richtext__ul">
<li aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="2" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" data-aria-posinset="2" data-aria-level="1"><span data-contrast="auto"><span>Du blir aldri ferdig utlært. Studiet gir deg grunnmuren, men du må bygge videre selv.&nbsp;</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}">&nbsp;</span></li>
</ul>
<ul class="Richtext__ul">
<li aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="2" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" data-aria-posinset="3" data-aria-level="1"><span data-contrast="auto"><span>Bygg en portefølje. Lag prosjekter, skriv blogg, del på LinkedIn eller GitHub. Vis at du bryr deg.</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}">&nbsp;</span></li>
</ul>
<ul class="Richtext__ul">
<li aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="2" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" data-aria-posinset="4" data-aria-level="1"><span data-contrast="auto"><span>Engasjer</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span>deg<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>i</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>miljøet</span><span>. Delta<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>på</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span>CTF-er (capture the flag), meetups<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>og</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>konferanser</span><span>. Du<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>lærer</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>mye</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>og</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>dann</span><span>er</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span>deg et<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>godt</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>nettverk</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>som</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span>er<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>utrolig</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>viktig</span><span>.&nbsp;</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240,&quot;335559740&quot;:279,&quot;335559991&quot;:360}">&nbsp;</span></li>
</ul>
</div></div></div><section class="Richtext__block">
